ve to European elites are used by new social groups or for generating anti-monumental artifacts that directly challenge the state and the ruling classes. In conflicts, therefore, it is not so much the monument which is relevant but rather what happens to the communities that participate in its construction or destruction and their instigation of forms of social interaction..', '📖 pork: 🔹 pork: The meat of a pig; swineflesh.', '📖 moist: 🔹 moist: To moisten.']
